                                                <TextBlock Text="Mass Effect Andromeda Save Editor" Foreground="#00D2FF" FontWeight="Bold" FontSize="15" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
                                                <TextBlock Text="A modern, safe, and comprehensive save editing suite for Mass Effect: Andromeda on PC, developed by RoxasSmithSolutions (RSS). This editor gives you complete control over your Andromeda playthrough, allowing you to tailor Ryder's progression, armory, combat profiles, and crafting supplies with an intuitive graphical interface." Foreground="{StaticResource TextNormal}" FontSize="11.5" TextWrapping="Wrap" LineHeight="17" Margin="0,0,0,8"/>
                                                <TextBlock Text="Built with deep byte-level Frostbite 3 engine chunk parsing to ensure save integrity, preservation of binary chunk headers, and zero risk of save corruption." Foreground="{StaticResource TextMuted}" FontSize="11" TextWrapping="Wrap" LineHeight="16"/>
                                            </StackPanel>
                                        </Grid>
                                    </Border>

                                    <!-- Core Features Card -->
                                    <Border Background="{StaticResource CardBg}" BorderBrush="{StaticResource BorderColor}" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="4" Padding="16,14" Margin="0,0,0,10">
                                        <Grid>
                                            <Border Width="4" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Background="#06B6D4" CornerRadius="4,0,0,4"/>
                                            <StackPanel Margin="14,0,0,0">
                                                <TextBlock Text="Key Features &amp; Editor Capabilities" Foreground="#06B6D4" FontWeight="Bold" FontSize="13" Margin="0,0,0,8"/>
                                                <TextBlock Text="• Role-Play &amp; Campaign: Customize Ryder's name, gender (Scott or Sara), campaign difficulty level, and current planet or starship location." Foreground="{StaticResource TextNormal}" FontSize="11" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,3"/>
                                                <TextBlock Text="• Progression &amp; Stats: Modify Ryder Level, XP, Skill Points, Credits, Nexus Level, A.V.P., and Research Data (Milky Way, Heleus, Remnant)." Foreground="{StaticResource TextNormal}" FontSize="11" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,3"/>
                                                <TextBlock Text="• Inventory Capacity Management: Review and customize Ryder's item capacity (100 base, 150 with Trade Capacity I, 200 with Trade Capacity II) to avoid encumbrance." Foreground="{StaticResource TextNormal}" FontSize="11" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,3"/>
                                                <TextBlock Text="• Armory &amp; Tier X Gear: Browse, manage, and add Weapons, Weapon Mods, Armor, Fusion Mods, and Consumables. Upgrade any piece of gear up to Tier X (Max Tier) in one click." Foreground="{StaticResource TextNormal}" FontSize="11" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,3"/>
                                                <TextBlock Text="• Profiles &amp; Dynamic Archetype Themes: Switch active combat profiles with archetype illumination and adjust ranks from Rank 1 to 6 with real-time stat bonuses." Foreground="{StaticResource TextNormal}" FontSize="11" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,3"/>
                                                <TextBlock Text="• Resources &amp; Decryption: Edit all 17 minerals, bio/tech materials, augmentations, and add Remnant Decryption Keys to bypass monolith glyph puzzles." Foreground="{StaticResource TextNormal}" FontSize="11" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
